# D5.2 — Evolving Observational Structure and Candidate State Representation

**Status:** `[PROPOSED / DERIVATION PROGRAM — NOT CANONICAL]`

**Dependencies:**

$$
D1\rightarrow D2\rightarrow D3\rightarrow D4\rightarrow D4.5
